/T (This project focuses on transforming 2D images into digital holograms using computational techniques and deep learning. By generating phase maps and simulating light propagation, the platform reconstructs images to examine how accurately the original visual information is preserved. Using PyTorch-based learning and optimization, the project explores the factors affecting reconstruction quality and identifies opportunities to improve hologram generation.)
